# Agent scratch / credentials.
# Spec Kit's local install (.specify/), its per-agent command copies
# (.codebuddy/) and the workspace agent state (.workbuddy/, incl. the
# mirrored speckit commands and the daily work log) are machine-local:
# regenerate with `specify init --here --force --ignore-agent-tools
# --integration codebuddy --script py`, never merge them through git.
.codebuddy/
.specify/
.workbuddy/
